00:39:36,123 --> 00:39:37,249
My problem is,

853
00:39:38,000 --> 00:39:39,502
I'm not interested

854
00:39:39,585 --> 00:39:41,754
-in natural scenery.
-Seriously?

855
00:39:41,837 --> 00:39:43,839
INDIFFERENT ON SEORAKSAN TOO

