THE MODEL ARRIVES

965
00:44:04,600 --> 00:44:05,851
Why did you suddenly run?

966
00:44:05,934 --> 00:44:09,188
I thought it'd be nice
to have a clip of me running.

967
00:44:09,271 --> 00:44:11,231
HE'S BECOME A TRUE ENTERTAINER NOW

968
00:44:11,315 --> 00:44:12,441
You still have stamina left.

969
00:44:13,108 --> 00:44:14,443
Car-the is flying.

970
00:44:18,656 --> 00:44:20,032
Are you flying?

971
00:44:21,075 --> 00:44:23,118
-Balance.
-He's showing a lot of emotions today.

972
00:44:23,744 --> 00:44:24,912
I'm balancing myself.

973
00:44:24,995 --> 00:44:27,623
HE FLIES TO THE DESTINATION

974
00:44:28,290 --> 00:44:29,875
Dowoon, wasn't this how Hallasan felt?

975
00:44:29,958 --> 00:44:31,251
We came all that way,

976
00:44:31,335 --> 00:44:33,671
but they said
we'd only gone a third of the way.

977
00:44:33,754 --> 00:44:35,506
ENDLESS HIKING IS DÉJÀ VU
FOR GWANEUMSA TEAM

978
00:44:35,589 --> 00:44:36,632
-Hallasan?
-Yes.

979
00:44:36,715 --> 00:44:38,217
This is so much better than Hallasan.

980
00:44:38,300 --> 00:44:39,134
Of course.

981
00:44:39,218 --> 00:44:40,302
THEY ALL ARRIVE

982
00:44:41,136 --> 00:44:42,721
This is sick.

983
00:44:42,805 --> 00:44:45,391
APPROACHING THE TOWER OF STONES
THEY'D ONLY SEEN FROM AFAR

984
00:44:45,474 --> 00:44:46,308
This is nice.

985
00:44:48,602 --> 00:44:50,813
You're so handsome!

986
00:44:51,438 --> 00:44:53,482
I don't know who you are,
but you're handsome.

987
00:44:54,066 --> 00:44:55,234
Am I handsome?

988
00:44:55,317 --> 00:44:56,193
No.

989
00:44:56,276 --> 00:44:57,111
Not me?

990
00:44:57,194 --> 00:44:58,195
No, you're cool!

991
00:44:58,278 --> 00:44:59,196
Am I cool?

992
00:44:59,279 --> 00:45:00,114
FINE, ALREADY

993
00:45:00,197 --> 00:45:01,657
You're pretty too, ma'am.

994
00:45:01,740 --> 00:45:03,409
Sure, thanks.

995
00:45:03,492 --> 00:45:05,077
Hey, look at that guy.

996
00:45:05,160 --> 00:45:08,205
THAT GUY IS SMILING

997
00:45:08,872 --> 00:45:10,040
She said I'm not handsome.

998
00:45:10,833 --> 00:45:11,917
WHAT HAPPENED?

999
00:45:12,000 --> 00:45:13,669
-She said no.
-You look macho.

1000
00:45:13,752 --> 00:45:14,753
Well,

1001
00:45:14,837 --> 00:45:17,840
I guess she wanted to gaze
at some handsome men.

1002
00:45:17,923 --> 00:45:21,593
Since the mountains are rough,
I think she wanted to cleanse her eyes

1003
00:45:21,677 --> 00:45:24,930
